  "details": "Line breaks in avatars and world descriptions.\n\nWhy don't we have it?\n\nWe can use line breaks in bios and groups descriptions, but not in worlds and avatars.\n\nRight now, any line breaks in their descriptions being trimmed to just spaces.\n\nBut at the same time all the places where that descriptions used do have pretty long multiline UI alignment already.\n\nI see no reason for limitation of this basic text formatting feature.\n\nThis can be turned off server-side with no changes on client.",
